{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00416",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 3.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Okay, welcome. Let's see what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.83,
      "end_seconds": 7.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.05,
      "end_seconds": 12.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.48,
      "end_seconds": 15.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.64,
      "end_seconds": 18.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "She's been having fever, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.3,
      "end_seconds": 24.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 26.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "It's been five days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.07,
      "end_seconds": 34.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.1,
      "end_seconds": 47.92,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. A cold sponge helps a bit. I did try to ignore it for a while. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.8,
      "end_seconds": 51.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.55,
      "end_seconds": 69.39,
      "duration_seconds": 17.84,
      "text": "A blocked nose goes along with it, most of the time. The blocked nose? That's been for about a week. About blocked nose, it's severe, honestly. And a sore throat as well, since last night. About sore throat, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.9,
      "end_seconds": 72.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Any a mild headache as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.77,
      "end_seconds": 74.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.43,
      "end_seconds": 77.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "What's the pattern, is it there all day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.46,
      "end_seconds": 80.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.04,
      "end_seconds": 84.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any shortness of breath or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.99,
      "end_seconds": 89.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I haven't had shortness of breath or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.4,
      "end_seconds": 92.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Have you had any diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.67,
      "end_seconds": 96.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.69,
      "end_seconds": 99.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Have you had any burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.44,
      "end_seconds": 104.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any burning when passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 105.75,
      "end_seconds": 111.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice burning when passing urine. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.84,
      "end_seconds": 119.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.96,
      "end_seconds": 128.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.47,
      "end_seconds": 131.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 132.25,
      "end_seconds": 141.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temperature is 38.1 degrees, oxygen saturation is 95 percent. Pulse is 106 beats a minute, respiratory rate 19, pressure 112 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.41,
      "end_seconds": 150.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Okay, noted. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.86,
      "end_seconds": 164.16,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "I, I have diabetes, for about ten years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.37,
      "end_seconds": 168.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.5,
      "end_seconds": 174.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about ten years. Asthma, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.93,
      "end_seconds": 185.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.89,
      "end_seconds": 189.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Yes, I had a hernia repair, about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.63,
      "end_seconds": 192.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.66,
      "end_seconds": 197.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "My uncle had colon cancer. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.92,
      "end_seconds": 203.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.13,
      "end_seconds": 206.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.04,
      "end_seconds": 211.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Right, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.21,
      "end_seconds": 214.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.09,
      "end_seconds": 217.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.3,
      "end_seconds": 221.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.75,
      "end_seconds": 228.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.89,
      "end_seconds": 233.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.58,
      "end_seconds": 236.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.13,
      "end_seconds": 242.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "For two years. Seretide inhaler. I take it twice a day for my asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.36,
      "end_seconds": 245.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.07,
      "end_seconds": 259.53,
      "duration_seconds": 12.46,
      "text": "About six months. It's paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I used to take glimepiride, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.43,
      "end_seconds": 263.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.61,
      "end_seconds": 265.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.59,
      "end_seconds": 273.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.8,
      "end_seconds": 278.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.87,
      "end_seconds": 281.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Can you lie back for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.64,
      "end_seconds": 305.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Your throat looks red at the back, but there's no pus on the tonsils."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.93,
      "end_seconds": 309.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.55,
      "end_seconds": 322.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Chest is clear when I listen, no crackles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.89,
      "end_seconds": 326.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.87,
      "end_seconds": 338.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "The glands in your neck feel a little tender but not big."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.65,
      "end_seconds": 363.13,
      "duration_seconds": 19.48,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a viral upper respiratory infection. Influenza is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.33,
      "end_seconds": 366.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.15,
      "end_seconds": 381.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.67,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a viral upper respiratory infection, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had fever for five days, mild, and no shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.67,
      "end_seconds": 384.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.22,
      "end_seconds": 410.46,
      "duration_seconds": 22.24,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for fever. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We should do a flu swab for fever. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like to arrange a throat swab for sore throat. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.9,
      "end_seconds": 414.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.58,
      "end_seconds": 441.21,
      "duration_seconds": 26.63,
      "text": "I'll start you on cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for five days. That should help with blocked nose. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Stay home, rest, and keep the fluids up. Warm soups and water, anything that goes down easily. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.69,
      "end_seconds": 449.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 450.06,
      "end_seconds": 451.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 454.23,
      "end_seconds": 458.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Please come and see me if it's not settling in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 458.93,
      "end_seconds": 460.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.54,
      "end_seconds": 464.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 465.66,
      "end_seconds": 467.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 468.9,
      "end_seconds": 469.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}